  "details": "Precondition:\n\n1. Use VRChat on VR\n\n2. Load to any instance\n\n3. Open the camera\n\nReproduction steps:\n\n1. Click on the camera orientation change button\n\n2. Launch any of the standart VRChat animated emojis\n\nExpected Result: The emoji's orientation aligns with the camera's orientation\n\nActual Result: The orientation of the emoji does not match the camera. This is especially noticeable on the bee emoji",
